# Local reverse-engineering / scratch scripts (kept out of repo).
# Deny-by-default: every root-level script is scratch unless allowlisted
# below. Naming them one by one let a later batch slip through with a
# live API token in it. The real sources live in src/.
/*.mjs
/*.cjs
/*.js
/*.sh
!/eslint.config.js
/.backups/
.findings/
.tmp_*
